              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Angela Gruwell"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Perfect. I've been craving this and it's so simple and perfect. Nom. Dashi granules are often sold as \"hondashi\" or Bonito Soup Stock Bouillon. It doesn't say \"granules\" on the package. I found it in the spice section of 99 Ranch in a box."
          },
