            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Michelle"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious! I eat it like this, cold, or warm up my tofu in the microwave for a minute. I can even get my 3 year old to eat tofu this way. Remember to compress your tofu to release all the water that it has absorbed in order for it to absorb the flavor of this dressing instead before making this dish and it'll be much better!",
            "datePublished": "2017-11-15T23:40:45.970Z"
          },
          {
