            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "mrshorn08"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A delicious, refreshing, &amp; light dish. I served it as a side dish at a sushi making party with some friends. Bonito shavings can be hard to find, but I found a bottle of bonito flakes+black sesame seeds+seaweed flakes all in one at a local Japanese market. The black sesame flakes really pop against the tofu. Very yummy, will make again.",
            "datePublished": "2011-08-25T23:34:27.867Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
