            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "RoseCrisp6700"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious! This is the perfect dish when you don't have energy to cook because it is hot out. I veganized it by subbing the bonito for nutritional yeast flakes (available in health food stores) and I used kombu powder to sub for dashi. Then I served it with freshly made sushi rice.",
